<<< everything below this line is maintained by hand; scripts/third_party_licenses.sh keeps it when regenerating >>>
================================================================================
NATIVE LIBRARIES AND MODELS
================================================================================

The Rust crates are listed above. This part covers what is not a Rust crate:
the C/C++ libraries built into (or shipped beside) the vtmate binaries, and the
models embedded in them. Maintained by hand; see build.rs and the build_*
scripts for versions and sources.

Not included on purpose:
  - NVIDIA CUDA, cuBLAS and cuDNN are not bundled. The CUDA variants load them
    from the user's own NVIDIA installation at run time.
  - LLVM (Apache-2.0 with LLVM exception) is used to build the binaries; its
    exception waives the attribution requirement for the compiled output.

